5%.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (1.0x, 2.4% of sales), a maintenance pace.","Its Rule of 40 score is 26, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.6%), and institutions hold 93%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (6 sales, net $4.1M sold).","Shareholder yield is a modest 0.8% (0.8% in buybacks).","The share count has shrunk 1.7% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake."],"people":["CEO pay is $2.6M, and compensation governance scores well (3/10, lower is better)."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":59,"head":"Avoid: priced 63% above its fair value of $160.","pros":["ROIC 26.8% vs WACC 11.5%","FCF margin 23.8%","Net debt/EBITDA 0.7x","Altman Z in the safe zone","12 analysts' mean target $391 (+50%)"],"cons":["Trades 63% above fair value of $160","P/E 35.4x vs sector 24.4x","EV/EBITDA 22.4x vs sector 16.1x","P/FCF 34.8x vs sector 23.3x"],"flags":["Priced 63% above its fair value of $160"],"need":[],"buy_below":135.99,"vc":{"base":159.99,"base_src":"dcf","bear":107.15,"bull":237.16,"alt_median":52.55,"n_alt":2,"gap":2.0445,"dispersion":0.165,"level":"LOW","why":["DCF is 204% above the other models' median ($52.55)"]},"med":{"pe":24.3759,"ev_ebitda":16.132,"pfcf":23.2596,"pb":3.2577,"roic":0.075,"gross_margin":0.4677,"fcf_margin":0.1222,"div_yield":0.0137}},"mc_quantiles":[76.65,97.08,107.15,117.13,123.57,130.4,137.52,142.91,148.92,153.95,160.9,166.61,174.41,181.51,189.52,197.56,209.61,223.99,237.16,274.56,321.47],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.779,"discount_rate":0.197,"terminal_growth":0.007,"exit_multiple":0.017},"ticker":"KEYS","date":"2026-11-20"}